{"title":"Professor Grok","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Professor Grok is one of the main educators in the math program for 1-5 grade <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a>.\n</p><p>Professor is the legendary math-chemistry teacher. He is blue with a mad-scientist hairstyle. Unfortunately, he is constantly being abducted by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Calamitous_Clod&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Calamitous Clod (page does not exist)\">Calamitous Clod</a>.\n</p><p>This article is a stub. Help us out by expanding it.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Professor_Grok&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017205210\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 283/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.285      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.285      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35953:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017205210 and revision id 285493. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}